### Additional information

- When the schedule is regenerated, installment lines that are not yet closed and not linked to purchase documents are deleted and recreated; already closed lines remain unchanged.
- The total number of installments cannot be reduced below the number of already closed installments, and the amount of a block cannot be changed if it contains closed installments.